---
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Visitor Information — Starlight Park" prefix="../" active="visitor-info">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Visitor information" title="PLAN LESS.<br><em>ENJOY MORE.</em>" copy="The practical details for a relaxed visit, whether you are coming for ten minutes or the whole day." image="meadow.jpg" accent="orange" prefix="../" />
  <section class="info-grid section-pad">
    <article class="info-card reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Opening</p><h2>DAILY<br />FROM DAWN.</h2><p>Public landscapes and main walking routes are open daily. Programmed spaces may follow event-specific times.</p></article>
    <article class="info-card reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Getting here</p><h2>ARRIVE<br />LIGHTLY.</h2><p>Cycle parking and transit connections are prioritised near the principal entrances. Limited accessible parking is available.</p></article>
    <article class="info-card reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Access</p><h2>SPACE FOR<br />EVERY BODY.</h2><p>Primary paths use firm, step-free surfaces. Accessible restrooms, seating and water points are distributed across the park.</p></article>
    <article class="info-card reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Dogs</p><h2>PAWS<br />WELCOME.</h2><p>Dogs are welcome on lead across most routes. Follow signs around play, meadow and habitat areas.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="faq-section section-pad"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Before you go</p><h2>USEFUL<br />ANSWERS.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="reveal"><summary>Is there an admission fee?<span>+</span></summary><p>General park access is free. Some small programmed events may require advance booking.</p></details><details class="reveal"><summary>Can I bring food?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Use the provided bins or take waste home, and keep picnic setups clear of paths.</p></details><details class="reveal"><summary>What happens in bad weather?<span>+</span></summary><p>The park remains open unless conditions are unsafe. Event updates are shared on the relevant listing.</p></details></div></section>
</Layout>
